    <string name="tailscale_title">Do I need Tailscale?</string>
    <string name="tailscale_body">No. start-bridge.bat opens a secure tunnel by itself, so the app reaches your PC from anywhere, on Wi-Fi or mobile data, and finds it again after a restart without scanning. Tailscale is optional: if you install it on the PC and the phone with the same account, the app also uses it as a private, fixed route.</string>
